      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "そ、そんなことより……この橋はかなり高いな。\r\nお前たち、怖がるんじゃないぞ！",
        "official_en": "This tall bridge? No...although, it <text style=\"italic\">is</> a long way down... Don’t lose your nerve, you two!",
        "real_en": "N-never mind that... This bridge is <text style=\"italic\">really</> high up. Don't you two get scared!"
      },
